; claude: the live effects (plan_synth_teaching.md, notes_synth.md
; section 8): each a streaming processor with its own typed settings,
; and an Effect.t (Effect.mli) to be chained in a Rack, its knobs named.
; The effects of a sound rendered ahead (Synth's echo and reverb) are
; audio/'s. A private library, installed as part of elm_playground:
; pure OCaml, so the web backend has it too.
(library
 (name audio_effects)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries audio_signal audio_synthesis audio)
)
